   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "轉發 台灣電腦網路危機處理暨協調中心 TWCERTCC-200-202506-00000014",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Veeam Backup Replication是Veeam核心備份軟體，近日Veeam發布重大資安漏洞公告。此漏洞(CVE-2025-23121，CVSS：9.9)允許經網域驗證的使用者，在備份伺服器上可遠端執行任意程式碼。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "情資分享等級: WHITE(情資內容為可公開揭露之資訊)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[影響平台:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Veeam Backup Replication 12.3.1.1139 (含)之前版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[建議措施:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "請更新至 Veeam Backup Replication 12.3.2",
   "links": []
  },
